su name re-entry attempt be ceremony def
  su name draft out ob name task for name author to name text draft out be write do
  su name critique out ob name draft out for name critic to name text critique out be write do
  su name revised out ob name critique out for name author to name text revised out be write do
  su name revised out ret
prah

su name re-entry cycle fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 to name text output be ceremony def
  to name text latest fromindex num 0 toindex num of toindex of this be re-entry attempt do
  su name latest ret
prah

exists su name re-entry attempt be export ya
exists su name re-entry cycle be export ya
